{"id":"KORN","text":"The utilization of cereals","description":"The utilization of cereals by crop, period, origin, type and time","unit":"m kg","suppressedDataValue":"0","updated":"2026-09-11T08:00:00","active":true,"contacts":[{"name":"Mads Haaning Andersen","phone":"+4551857627","mail":"mhg@dst.dk"}],"documentation":{"id":"6b213a5d-ef43-4ac1-b1bf-c5be37b3f963","url":"https://www.dst.dk/documentationofstatistics/6b213a5d-ef43-4ac1-b1bf-c5be37b3f963"},"footnote":{"text":"The balance for crop year concerns the period from 1/7 the displayed year to 30/6 the following year. Two dots means either that a figure is not applicable or that there are no available data. The crop Maize also includes the import of crops such as buckwheat and sorghum. Due to great uncertainty in the figures for Maize in 2018-2019, the type Used for feeding is listed with dots. This means that Used for feed quantities for these periods do not correspond to the balance calculation for Used for feeding in the table. The crop balance is calculated as follows: (production lees waste + imports + stocks, primo) - (seeds + exports + grinding + for manufacturing + stocks, ultimo). Figures for the latest two calendar years and latest crop year are provisional.","mandatory":false},"variables":[{"id":"AFGRØDE","text":"crop","elimination":false,"time":false,"values":[{"id":"A6","text":"CEREALS, TOTAL"},{"id":"H105","text":"Wheat"},{"id":"H130","text":"Rye"},{"id":"H140","text":"Triticale"},{"id":"H145","text":"Barley"},{"id":"H172","text":"Oats"},{"id":"H615","text":"Maize"},{"id":"H204","text":"OILSEED, TOTAL"},{"id":"H205","text":"Rape seeds"}]},{"id":"PERIODE","text":"period","elimination":false,"time":false,"values":[{"id":"KAAR","text":"Calendar year"},{"id":"DAAR","text":"Working year (1/7 - 30/6)"}]},{"id":"OPRIND","text":"origin","elimination":false,"time":false,"values":[{"id":"004","text":"Total danish and imported"},{"id":"005","text":"Produced in DK"},{"id":"010","text":"Import"}]},{"id":"TYPE",